{"seq":2,"slug":"dpo-preference-optimization","title":"DPO 与偏好对齐优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/methods/dpo-preference-optimization","wordCount":1152,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dpo-与偏好对齐优化\">DPO 与偏好对齐优化</h1><p>监督微调（SFT）教会模型&quot;怎么回答&quot;，但无法教会它&quot;什么是好的回答&quot;。偏好对齐（Preference Alignment）填补这一空缺：让模型学会在多个候选回答中选择人类更偏好的那个。DPO（Direct Preference Optimization）在 2024 年取代 RLHF 成为偏好对齐的默认方法，到 2026 年，其变体（KTO、SimPO、ORPO、GRPO）已覆盖几乎所有对齐场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传统 RLHF 管线需要三个阶段：SFT → 训练奖励模型 → PPO 强化学习。DPO 的核心洞察是：可以将奖励模型隐式地嵌入策略本身，跳过显式的奖励建模和不稳定的 PPO 优化。</p>\n<p>DPO 的损失函数直接在偏好数据对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(y_w, y_l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margi