rut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 SFT 后的参考策略，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 控制偏离参考策略的程度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph RLHF三阶段&#10;        R1[SFT] --&gt; R2[训练奖励模型] --&gt; R3[PPO 优化]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph DPO两阶段&#10;        D1[SFT] --&gt; D2[直接偏好优化]&#10;    end&#10;    R3 -.-&gt;|DPO 等价但更简单| D2\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph RLHF三阶段\n        R1[SFT] --&gt; R2[训练奖励模型] --&gt; R3[PPO 优化]\n    end\n    subgraph DPO两阶段\n        D1[SFT] --&gt; D2[直接偏好优化]\n    end\n    R3 -.-&gt;|DPO 等价但更简单| D2</pre><h2 id=\"rlhf-vs-dpo-2026-年的生产决策\">RLHF vs DPO：2026 年的生产决策</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RLHF (PPO)</th>\n<th>DPO</th>\n<th>胜出方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工程复杂度</td>\n<td>4 个模型同时在内存</td>\n<td>2 个模型（policy + ref）</td>\n<td>DPO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练稳定性</td>\n<td>PPO 超参敏感</td>\n<td>接近标准监督学习</td>\n<td>DPO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标控制</td>\n<td>可调奖励权重</td>\n<td>单一偏好信号</td>\n<td>RLHF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线适应</td>\n<td>天然支持在线学习</td>\n<td>需要 iterative DPO 变体</td>\n<td>RLHF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据效率</td>\n<td>需要大量偏好对</td>\n<td>同等数据量效果更好</td>\n<td>DPO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可复现性</td>\n<td>随机性高</td>\n<td>确定性强</td>\n<td>DPO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的实践共识：<strong>DPO 是默认选择</strong>，RLHF 仅在需要多目标精细控制或在线持续对齐时使用。前沿实验室（如 Anthropic、OpenAI）仍在内部使用 RLHF 变体，但多数中小团队已全面转向 DPO 家族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dpo-变体-解决不同痛点\">DPO 变体：解决不同痛点</h2><p><strong>KTO（Kahneman-Tversky Optimization）</strong>——不需要配对偏好数据，只需要对单条回答标注&quot;好/坏&quot;（binary feedback）。适用于偏好标注成本高、只能获得点赞/点踩数据的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>KTO</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mtext>good</mtext></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mtext>bad</mtext></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{KTO}} = \\mathbb{E}_{y \\sim \\text{good}} [1 - \\sigma(r)] + \\mathbb{E}_{y \\sim \\text{bad}} [1 - \\sigma(-r)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">KTO</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">good</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bad</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>SimPO（Simple Preference Optimization）</strong>——去除参考模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_{\\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，直接用序列平均对数概率作为隐式奖励，训练时无需加载参考模型副本，显存节省约 40%。</p>\n<p><strong>ORPO（Odds Ratio Preference Optimization）</strong>——将 SFT 和偏好对齐合并为一个阶段，使用 odds ratio 替代 log probability ratio，消除了 SFT → DPO 的两阶段流程。</p>\n<p><strong>GRPO（Group Relative Policy Optimization）</strong>——DeepSeek 提出，用于 RLVR（Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Rewards）场景。对同一 prompt 生成多个候选，用可验证的评判器（如数学验算）打分，组内相对排序替代人工偏好标注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏好数据构建\">偏好数据构建</h2><p>偏好数据的质量直接决定对齐效果。三种主要获取方式：</p>\n<p><strong>人工标注</strong>——成本最高但质量最可控。标注员对同一 prompt 的两个回答标注偏好关系。常见平台：Scale AI、Surge AI。</p>\n<p><strong>AI 反馈（RLAIF）</strong>——用更强的模型（如 GPT-4）作为评判者，批量生成偏好标注。成本降低 10-100 倍，但存在&quot;强模型偏见复制&quot;风险。</p>\n<p><strong>拒绝采样（Rejection Sampling）</strong>——对同一 prompt 生成 N 个回答，用评分函数选出最佳与最差，自动构建偏好对。适用于有可验证指标的任务（代码执行正确性、数学答案准确性）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见失败模式与应对\">常见失败模式与应对</h2><p><strong>长度黑客（Length Hacking）</strong>——模型学会通过生成更长的回答来获得更高偏好分。应对：在奖励中加入长度惩罚，或使用 SimPO 的序列平均对数概率。</p>\n<p><strong>模式坍缩（Mode Collapse）</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 过小导致模型过度偏离参考策略，输出多样性急剧下降。应对：增大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 或使用 IPO 的 bounded rationality 正则化。</p>\n<p><strong>似然位移（Likelihood Displacement）</strong>——DPO 训练后偏好回答和非偏好回答的绝对似然可能同时下降。应对：使用 PRO（NeurIPS 2025）的完整正则化项恢复绝对似然。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DPO 将 RLHF 的三阶段简化为两阶段，工程复杂度大幅降低</li>\n<li>KTO 只需二元反馈、SimPO 去除参考模型、ORPO 合并 SFT+对齐、GRPO 用可验证奖励</li>\n<li>2026 年共识：DPO 为默认方法，RLHF 仅用于多目标或在线对齐场景</li>\n<li>偏好数据质量 &gt; 方法选择，数据构建是对齐工程的核心投资</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"unsloth-training-acceleration\">Unsloth 训练加速框架</a>——如何在有限硬件上高效完成 DPO/GRPO 训练</li>\n<li><a href=\"../evaluation/training-data-engineering\">微调数据工程与合成数据</a>——偏好数据构建的详细方法论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DPO 与偏好对齐优化","id":"dpo-与偏好对齐优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RLHF vs DPO：2026 年的生产决策","id":"rlhf-vs-dpo-2026-年的生产决策"},{"level":2,"text":"DPO 变体：解决不同痛点","id":"dpo-变体-解决不同痛点"},{"level":2,"text":"偏好数据构建","id":"偏好数据构建"},{"level":2,"text":"常见失败模式与应对","id":"常见失败模式与应对"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"LoRA 与 QLoRA 低秩适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/methods/lora-qlora"},"next":{"title":"Unsloth 训练加速框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/llm-fine-tuning/methods/unsloth-training-acceleration"}}